{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Scheme.For_ppx</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"neural_nets_lib","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Ocannl_tensor","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Tensor","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Scheme","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"For_ppx","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>The runtime the <code>%op</code> expansion calls. Not for direct use.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-closure\"><a href=\"#val-closure\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> closure : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">arity</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><span><a href=\"../index.html#type-tensor\">tensor</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'r</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../index.html#type-handle\">handle</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Traces now, the body applied to tracers: the <code>()</code> stage of a <code>%op</code> function. Its value gives the scheme's results (see above), then is dropped.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-deferred\"><a href=\"#val-deferred\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> deferred : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">arity</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><span><a href=\"../index.html#type-tensor\">tensor</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'r</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../index.html#type-handle\">handle</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Traces at the first application: a <code>%op</code> function without a <code>()</code> stage.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-at_site\"><a href=\"#val-at_site\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> at_site : \u000A  <span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>at_site __POS__ (fun () -&gt; f args)</code>: an application written in <code>%op</code> code, run with its source position recorded for the checks inside it to name (gh-ocannl-2007); the outer one is restored afterwards.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-apply\"><a href=\"#val-apply\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> apply : <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-handle\">handle</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span><a href=\"../index.html#type-tensor\">tensor</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>(<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>apply h args body</code> (tracing <code>h</code>'s scheme first when pending or stale) checks the scheme against <code>args</code> -- naming the innermost <a href=\"#val-at_site\"><code>at_site</code></a> in progress, if any -- then runs <code>body</code>. Inside a trace, and when unschemed, only runs <code>body</code>. So it does inside the <code>body</code> of an application that was checked, whose scheme holds this application's constraints (gh-ocannl-1814), but for tracing the presence patterns of a function on its first application.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-closure_variants\"><a href=\"#val-closure_variants\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> closure_variants : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">optional</span>:<span><span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.option</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><span><span><a href=\"../index.html#type-tensor\">tensor</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.option</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'r</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../index.html#type-handle\">handle</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><a href=\"#val-closure\"><code>closure</code></a> for a function with option-valued tensor parameters: <code>optional</code> names each position's option-valued parameter (<code>None</code>: a required tensor, passed as <code>Some</code>). Traces every presence pattern now.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-deferred_variants\"><a href=\"#val-deferred_variants\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> deferred_variants : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">optional</span>:<span><span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.option</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><span><span><a href=\"../index.html#type-tensor\">tensor</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.option</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'r</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../index.html#type-handle\">handle</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><a href=\"#val-deferred\"><code>deferred</code></a> likewise: every presence pattern is traced at the first application.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-apply_variants\"><a href=\"#val-apply_variants\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> apply_variants : \u000A  <span><a href=\"../index.html#type-handle\">handle</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span><a href=\"../index.html#type-tensor\">tensor</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.option</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><a href=\"#val-apply\"><code>apply</code></a> for the variant handles: the arguments' presence selects the scheme checked against the present arguments.</p></div></div>"}